{"id":"n66160-1-10","stage":5,"title":"신경통 · 神经痛","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66160-1-10-1","ko":"할머니, 허리가 아프세요? 제가 좀 주물러 드릴까요?","zh":"奶奶，您腰疼吗？让我帮您按按好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶","explanation":"할머니：奶奶。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"2","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}},{"text":"허리가","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허리가","audio":"/audio/ce5c6c7b6a73dfaf9320.mp3"}},{"text":"아프세요?","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프세요","audio":"/audio/2946510bbac50794cfd8.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"주물러","meaning":"揉，揉捏","explanation":"주무르다：揉，揉捏；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"주무르다","audio":"/audio/e4c9db12fe328c863d86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75174","senseId":"1","lemma":"주무르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주물러","audio":"/audio/306052a12f4ec3dc9343.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴까요","audio":"/audio/235c96fe68d709255264.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"(亲近)用于指称或称呼年老的女性。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"777cb8e222698603","term":"허리","zh":"腰","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3","entryId":"30201","definition":"人或动物身体上从肋骨下方到尾骨的部分。","pronunciation":["허리"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"e4c9db12fe328c86","term":"주무르다","zh":"揉，揉捏","audio":"/audio/e4c9db12fe328c863d86.mp3","entryId":"75174","definition":"用手将某个东西或身体反复握紧又放开，一直摆弄。","pronunciation":["주무르다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9d6f8da7dc73a3e14622.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66160-1-10-2","ko":"그래. 요즘 신경통이 부쩍 심해지는구나.","zh":"嗯。最近我的神经痛越来越严重了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entr