:"신경통","zh":"神经痛","audio":"/audio/84ab5e20dec3697a0825.mp3","entryId":"66160","definition":"神经突然反复疼痛的症状。","pronunciation":["신경통"]},{"id":"81b0ce3160def2f0","term":"부쩍","zh":"猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/81b0ce3160def2f0f1ac.mp3","entryId":"60036","definition":"某事物或某现象突然发生巨大变化的样子。","pronunciation":["부쩍"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8cfef381000a7944e9c8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.194,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66160","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0207,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。最近我的神经痛越来越严重了啊。","奶奶，您腰疼吗？让我帮您按按好吗？","妈妈，我不想吃豆芽。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["奶奶，您腰疼吗？让我帮您按按好吗？","妈妈，我不想吃豆芽。","嗯。最近我的神经痛越来越严重了啊。"],"answer":2}]}
